@crossbind/port-tiff-bin-wasi ships statically linked binaries aggregating multiple
third-party components. The full license text of every component follows
below.

Effective license expression (also package.json "license"):

    (Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception OR Apache-2.0 OR MIT) AND (Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception) AND libtiff AND Zlib

